Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The judgment and award dated 18.03.2020 passed in MVC.No.754/2019 by the Court of the Principal Senior Civil Judge and MACT-IV at Davanagere, is modified;
- 11 - NC: 2025:KHC:5857 iii) The claimants would be entitled to a sum of Rs.23,39,502/- as against Rs.14,04,450/- awarded by the tribunal;
Smt Drakshayanamma vs Sri Kotresh K G on 10 February, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/62348246/
5 iv)

This Court deems it appropriate to order for release of the enhanced compensation in favour of the - 12 - NC: 2025:KHC:5857 appellants upon furnishing the required Bank details/upon proper identification;
vii) All other terms and conditions stipulated by the tribunal are undisturbed and retained;
viii) The original records shall be transmitted to the jurisdictional tribunal forthwith.
 ix) Ordered accordingly.

